* Created by KLayout
*** My special header ***

* cell mac
* pin VDD
* pin VMID
* pin VSS
* pin a
* pin and_out
* pin b
* pin cin
* pin cout
* pin or_out
* pin sum
* pin x
.SUBCKT mac VDD VMID VSS a and_out b cin cout or_out sum x
* cell instance $1 r0 *1 180,123.2
X$1 VDD cout VMID x \$3 cin sum VSS full_adder
* cell instance $2 r0 *1 20,500
X$2 a b \$12 \$13 VDD \$3 VSS mul
* cell instance $3 r0 *1 1360,600
X$3 VDD \$16 or_out VSS inverter
* cell instance $4 r0 *1 1160,600
X$4 VDD \$13 \$16 VSS inverter
* cell instance $5 r0 *1 960,600
X$5 VDD \$12 and_out VSS inverter
.ENDS mac

* cell full_adder
* pin VDD
* pin cout
* pin VMID
* pin a
* pin b
* pin cin
* pin sum
* pin VSS
.SUBCKT full_adder VDD cout VMID a b cin sum VSS
* cell instance $1 r0 *1 1468.45,-98.25
X$1 VDD \$1 cout VSS inverter
* cell instance $2 r0 *1 1312,-98.25
X$2 VDD \$1 VMID \$15 \$8 VSS nany
* cell instance $4 r0 *1 -96.05,-98.25
X$4 \$15 VMID VDD \$11 a b VSS half_adder
* cell instance $5 r0 *1 600.9,-98.25
X$5 \$8 VMID VDD sum \$11 cin VSS half_adder
.ENDS full_adder

* cell mul
* pin a
* pin b
* pin t1
* pin t3
* pin VDD
* pin p
* pin VSS
.SUBCKT mul a b t1 t3 VDD p VSS
* cell instance $1 r0 *1 240,100
X$1 VDD a b \$4 VSS mul_nor
* cell instance $2 r0 *1 40,100
X$2 VDD a b t1 VSS mul_nand
* cell instance $3 r0 *1 640,100
X$3 VDD t1 t3 p VSS mul_nand
* cell instance $4 r0 *1 440,100
X$4 VDD \$4 t3 VSS mul_inv
.ENDS mul

* cell half_adder
* pin carry
* pin VMID
* pin VDD
* pin sum
* pin a
* pin b
* pin VSS
.SUBCKT half_adder carry VMID VDD sum a b VSS
* cell instance $1 r0 *1 496,200
X$1 VDD carry VMID \$11 \$12 VSS nany
* cell instance $2 r0 *1 508,0
X$2 VDD sum VMID \$4 carry VSS nany
* cell instance $3 r0 *1 184,0
X$3 VDD \$7 VMID \$3 carry VSS nany
* cell instance $4 r0 *1 328,200
X$4 VDD \$12 VMID b \$3 VSS nany
* cell instance $5 r0 *1 160,200
X$5 VDD \$3 VMID a b VSS nany
* cell instance $6 r0 *1 352,0
X$6 VDD \$7 \$4 VSS inverter
* cell instance $7 r0 *1 40,200
X$7 VDD a \$11 VSS inverter
.ENDS half_adder

